                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> is a registered owner of Real Properties situated in this municipality and that taxes has beed paid from </Value>
